rm{ZfcMeasure10BorelMeasure}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure10BorelMeasure}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure10\\text{-}borel\\text{-}measure} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure10BorelMeasure}_S(\\mu,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3BorelMeasure}_S(X,\\tau,\\mu)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure10\\text{-}borel\\text{-}measure} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure10BorelMeasure}_S(\\mu,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3BorelMeasure}_S(X,\\tau,\\mu)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This later label is a typed compatibility alias for the Borel-measure predicate, with the historical argument order preserved.</li>\n<li>The aliased predicate already carries the topology and measure-space guards, so duplicating their unused symbols here would create false local dependencies.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-measure3-borel-measure","status":"resolved","id":"92553ae434bb637e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-measure3-borel-measure]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-measure3-borel-measure","status":"resolved","id":"92553ae434bb637e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3BorelMeasure}_S$ (Borel-measure predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-measure3-borel-measure]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu,X,\\tau\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3BorelMeasure}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure10BorelMeasure}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure10\\text{-}borel\\text{-}measure} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure10BorelMeasure}_S(\\mu,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3BorelMeasure}_S(X,\\tau,\\mu)","display":true}],"bytes":1131,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2538","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-zfc-measure10-borel-measure.md|58-df-zfc-measure10-borel-measure]]（batch06）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","92553ae434bb637e"]}